Patch do motor: fronteiras de composição em frames inteiros.

Base: work/video-agent-kit-plugin @ d9fe300
Arquivo: mcp/ve_tools/render.py (somente este; condense_lang.py WIP não incluído)

Aplicar (sem executar setup-engine.sh):
  cd work/video-agent-kit-plugin
  git apply --check ../../scripts/engine/assembly-frame-boundaries.patch
  git apply ../../scripts/engine/assembly-frame-boundaries.patch

Reverter:
  cd work/video-agent-kit-plugin
  git checkout -- mcp/ve_tools/render.py

Verificar:
  VE_PLUGIN_ROOT="$PWD/work/video-agent-kit-plugin" node --experimental-strip-types scripts/assembly-proof.ts
  Esperado: exit 0, frameChecks baseline+fractional {frameCount 50, firstBlue 25}.
